  "prefLabel": "Puc 1602.02 Compliance tariff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.02 “Compliance tariff” means a tariff or tariff pages containing schedules of rates, charges, and terms and conditions that are filed by a utility to implement a commission order. The term includes “compliance tariff pages”.\n\nSource. #8428, eff 9-10-05 (from Puc 1601.02); ss by #10535, eff 3-4-14 (from Puc 1602.01); ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24",
